    <center><h3>Built for DIY – Installed in Minutes</h3></center>
    <center><p>
See how CLAD100’s tongue-and-groove panels click together for fast, clean installation. No track system required, concealed fastening, and lightweight aluminum make DIY installs simple and efficient.</p></center>
    <center><h3>One System. Seamless Compatibility </h3></center>
    <center><p>
CLAD100 panels interlock precisely to create a continuous, no-gap surface. Designed for vertical or horizontal installation across walls, ceilings, façades, and fences — interior or exterior.</p></center>
    <center><h3>Engineered for Strength &amp; Durability
</h3></center>
    <center><p>
Manufactured from 6063-T6 architectural-grade aluminum with a long-lasting powder-coat finish. Rust-proof, corrosion-resistant, UV-stable, and non-combustible for reliable performance in any environment.</p></center>
